# Unslop — TA queue + student asks (visual only)

Scope: `TaWorkspace.jsx`, `StudentAsksPage.jsx`, `styles.css` tokens.
No other pages. No prop/hook/API/router changes. No new deps.

## Tokens
- Colors: `--theme-ink/forest/deep/mist/sand/surface` + `aui-*`.
- Type: Source Sans 3 / Source Serif 4 only.
- Spacing: `gap-3`/`gap-4` / `mt-3`. No multi-shadows or glow.

## Density (TA queue)
- Dense list rows ~40–48px tall, 1px dividers, no card-per-row.
- Columns only if data exists: student, ask summary, course, wait time, status.
- Fixed map: queue list → selected ask → actions.

## Surfaces
- Flat surfaces; borders over cards. No gradients, icon circles, decorative badge rows, dashed boxes.
- Help Coach demoted (quieter chrome); controls stay fully usable.

## Copy examples
- Outcomes: "Claim ask", "Send reply", "Mark resolved", "Ask for help".
- Empty queue: "No open asks. New asks appear here."
- Glossary: Ask Triage, Help Coach, Quiet ask. No AI-hype filler.

## Never do
- Non-interactive cards, layout rewrites beyond these two screens, purple glow, dark-mode experiments.
- Changing fetch/auth/queue filters or Help Coach API payloads.
- Vague labels ("Submit", "Continue"); new animation/gesture libraries.

## Interaction and craft
1. Instant press feedback on primary actions: `:active` opacity only — no scale, no delayed chrome.
2. Keep the spatial map fixed: queue list, selected ask, and actions always in the same places.
3. Simplicity over chrome: one obvious primary action per view; demote Help Coach and secondary copy.
4. Labels name the outcome ("Claim ask", "Send reply"). No vague "Submit" or "Continue".
5. Honor prefers-reduced-motion. Add no springs, animation libraries or gesture libraries.
6. Craft: keep the gap-3/gap-4 rhythm, and remove leftover dashed boxes and muted filler lines.
